WEBVTT

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.410
Disgaea

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:15.710
Ai no tameiki ni
shibarareteru mitai.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:20.780
Donna jumon de mo
hodokenai no yo.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:28.500
Urei wo hisometa
shizuka na hitomi ga...

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:33.730
...yokei ni kokoro
kakimidashiteku.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:42.280
Sunao ja nai watashi
yori motto...

00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:48.510
...sunao ja nai anata
ga itoshii.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:54.680
Anata ga ii no,
akuma de mo ii.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:01:01.390
Ah, ima meguriaeta kiseki.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:07.900
Kienai kizu mo,
fukai karuma mo.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:11.240
Ah, aishitageru,

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:13.740
doko ni ite mo
nando demo.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:22.380
Aishitageru.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.820
Laharl, we have
a problem!

00:01:34.330 --> 00:01:37.430
Laharl, wake up!
Laharl!

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:39.400
It's a big emergency!

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:44.100
Laharl, wake up!
Please wake up!

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:46.930
PLEASE WAKE UP!

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:53.410
What is it? For your sake, I hope it's
important enough to disturb my sleep.

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.010
Of course!

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:03.820
A Solomon-style Judgment
at the Dinero Castle?!

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:08.090
It's over here, Laharl!
Hurry! Hurry!

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.590
I'm coming, already!
Unhand me!

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:15.660
Better treatment
for Prinnies, dood!

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.370
What the hell do you
think you're doing?

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:20.900
Pay us, dood!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:23.010
We're on strike until
we get our pay, dood!

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:24.810
We demand better
working conditions, dood!

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.610
<i>This is the
big emergency?</i>

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.380
Yes!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:34.210
I mean, if the Prinnies go on strike, you won't
have anyone to look after your needs, right?

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:36.230
So? You do it.
Problem solved.

00:02:37.290 --> 00:02:39.160
But I can't!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:43.300
You rank even lower than the Prinnies!
When I tell you to do something, you do it!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.260
Yes, sir! Helping people in need is
also part of an angel's duties!

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.360
I'll do my best!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:53.000
Anyway, why should I have
to pay the Prinnies wages?

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:56.640
Well, my vassals are by default
YOUR vassals, right, Highness?

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.340
In which case, it stands to reason that
you should be the one to pay them.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.810
I think not!
You pay them.

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:04.920
Cheapskate.

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:07.010
What?!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.180
Now, now!
No fighting!

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.960
Why do they need money
in the first place?

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:16.760
Oh, that.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:24.970
Inside each of these guys is a soul
that's committed sins.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:28.510
Once they either perform an
equal number of good deeds,

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:33.140
or save up enough money to equal the weight
to their sins, they can be reincarnated.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:37.020
Oh, I didn't know...
In that case, we really do have to pay them.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.560
I'm hungry!
Feed me!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.830
<i>You want me
to make it?</i>

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.360
Of course!

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.600
Are you trying
to kill me?!

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:08.850
I'm sorry. As much as I love to eat,
I'm not so good at cooking things...

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.510
Cook me something else!

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.350
Sure, but it'll be worse
than this.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:16.420
And you two think that you're
qualified to be my servants?!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:21.860
Of all the worthless...

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.830
If I pay you, you'll cook
for me, right?

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:27.370
Sure will, dood!

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:30.570
Right, then! I'll go to get
the Prinny Squad its pay!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:34.070
Take me to the richest
person in the area!

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:35.750
Yahoo!

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:44.690
One, two, three,
four, five, six...

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.720
All right, this is all
of it.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:52.850
<i>I want you to pledge fealty to me, Zenisky,
no, Overlord Zenisky,</i>

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:55.930
...and not even think
about defying me!

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.230
Are you sure
about that?

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:07.000
So, Krichevskoy's son
has returned, eh?

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.010
Which is the
true Overlord?

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:12.810
You, the former butler of the old Overlord,
or his son, Laharl?

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.020
The Demon Tome here is proof
that you are Overlord!

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:23.520
It's been handed from Overlord to Overlord
through the generations in the Netherworld!

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:28.130
My having this means that
I am the legitimate Overlord!

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:29.790
Yes, sire!

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.400
Daddy?

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:39.200
Oh, is that you, Koganesky?
What's the matter?

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:43.540
Do you want me
to get you anything?

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:47.410
Daddy, do you know what
everyone calls you?

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:48.680
No, what's that?

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.650
"Zenisky the Money-grubber"!

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.120
That's just the grumblings
of the sore losers!

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.130
Let them talk all they want,
I don't care.

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.130
Money-grubber! Money-grubber!

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:00.960
Money-grubber! Money-grubber!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.000
Money-grubber! Money-grubber!
Koganesky! Stop that nonsense this instant!

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:04.370
Money-grubber!
Koganesky! Stop that nonsense this instant!

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:04.430
Money-grubber!

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:05.240
Money-grubber!
No matter what they say,

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:05.860
No matter what they say,

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:09.170
I have the Demon Tome!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:14.270
As long as I have that, I'm Overlord
no matter what anyone says!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:21.270
I wish you'd never become
the stinky Overlord!

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:26.050
Look at what
you've done!

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:30.250
This vase cost me
7 million HL!

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:32.930
Oh, no...

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:35.860
Look at you...
I hate you, Daddy!

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.940
Plunder everything that
isn't nailed down!

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:45.600
Aye aye, dood!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:57.210
Um... Doesn't this
amount to burglary?

00:06:57.320 --> 00:07:01.350
What's your point? It's the owner's fault for
leaving home with all this stuff lying around.

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:04.480
Yeah, yeah! He brought it
on himself!

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:08.060
You two always try to rationalize
the bad things you do,

00:07:08.470 --> 00:07:12.300
...but you can't waltz in and steal other
people's... er, other DEMONS'... property!

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.510
Please, everyone!
Stop this!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:18.600
- Right! Next up is Humbaba's place!
- Aye, dood!

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:20.300
No, you can't!

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.670
Next up, the Minotaur's place!

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:27.080
- Aye, dood!
- You're gonna loot more houses?!

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:31.720
Right, next up is the
Death Boar's place!

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:34.090
- Aye, dood!
- Stealing is wrong!

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:39.390
500 HL is about as high
as I can go.

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:44.630
500 HL?
Is that a lot? Or a little?

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.730
YOU COULD NOT BUYA PIZZA
AT BERNIE'S FOR THIS.

00:07:48.210 --> 00:07:50.230
Mister, run the
numbers again!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.500
If you don't like the offer,
try someplace else.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.710
You're just trying to take us for a ride
because we're human, aren't you?!

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.940
JENNIFER! TIME FOR YOU
TO DO YOUR THING.

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:00.210
Coming!

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:04.910
Please, Mr. Shopkeeper, this would
be a personal favor to me...

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:07.920
We're in a real tight
bind here...

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:12.930
A-All right, all right... For you,
I'll throw in a little extra.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:14.920
Here...

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:20.200
Goodness, what a sweethearted
demon you are!

00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:23.530
I'm in your debt... I'm looking forward
to doing business with you again.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:31.140
Would it be all right
if I took this book, too?

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.540
G-Go right ahead...

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:34.780
MEN IN THE NETHERWORLD ARE
PRETTY STRAIGHTFORWARD TOO, I SEE.

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:38.650
At this rate, we'll have enough to
cover our repair bill in no time!

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:41.880
It's only a matter of time before
our spaceship is as good as new!

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:54.200
I want to hock
all this crap!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.130
S-Sure thing, sir.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:59.310
It's for our Prinnies' paychecks, so
just give us whatever you feel like.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.870
You can't! Please pay them
lots of money!

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:04.940
More importantly, isn't there
any food in here?

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:06.210
Hey!

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:12.550
How dare you trample over the great
Captain Gordon, Defender of Earth?!

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.990
Oh, it's Mr. Gordon!
Hello!

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.420
Oh, for crying out loud...
You're still here, human?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:23.060
Naturally. I've been earning money to pay
for repairs on my ship, which YOU wrecked!

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:25.360
WE JUST FINISHED PAWNING
SOME DEFENDER MERCHANDISE.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.990
Wow, is there really a line
of Defender merchandise?!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:30.270
I'd love to have something!
I'll buy something!

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:31.900
HAVE A LOOK AT
OUR CATALOG.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.340
Oh, thank you
so much!

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.780
Perhaps you'd like to buy something,
too, Prince? I'll give you a discount.

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:40.320
Not interested! It'll shoot
my HL's to hell!

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.540
My, what a stingy boy
you are!

00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:44.850
And that wasn't
a very good pun, either.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:47.750
Get thee behind me,
hussy!

00:09:50.090 --> 00:09:52.430
That was horrible!
They didn't do anything to you!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:56.120
Look, I'm about to die of hunger over here!
Is there any food, or what?!

00:09:57.000 --> 00:10:00.030
Make ABSOLUTELY sure that you don't put
these anywhere the Prince might see them!

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:04.400
If he spots one here, all the work I've
put into this will go up in smoke!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:06.340
That'll be extra, dood.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:09.710
I-I'll cut you
a special deal!

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.340
You find something
back there?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:15.080
I hope for your sake that you're not
eating something behind my back!

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:18.620
I wouldn't dream of eating something
and not sharing it with you, Highness!

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:21.190
I can't trust a word
you say.

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:24.350
Look out, Highness!

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:29.820
W-Why, you little...

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:35.370
Hey, this is...
This is my old cradle!

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:39.870
This one...
And that one, too!

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.470
All this stuff used to be
in the Overlord's Castle!

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:44.580
What's it doing
in a pawn shop?!

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:46.840
Burglars must've
swiped them.

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:49.450
You know, sometime during the
two years you spent napping.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:51.350
It's your own fault for leaving them
out while you were away, dood!

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.680
You brought it
on yourself, dood!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.520
I got burglarized...

00:10:56.490 --> 00:10:59.620
Oh, wow! What's this?
It's so cute!

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:02.890
It looks like King Krichevskoy's
favorite fountain pen.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.930
You mean Laharl's father?

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.440
Yep. Um, let's see...

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.270
Ah, over there!
That's him!

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:13.930
Wow, so that's
Overlord Krichevskoy...

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:17.680
That's the man himself.
He was such a great man...

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.250
Isn't that right, Highness?

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.930
You're still too young,
Laharl.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:33.220
I wanna read it!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.360
Then you must first
become Overlord.

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:36.590
That goes without saying.

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:39.960
I have no doubt
that you will!

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.140
I had always planned to take out
the old geezer myself,

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.280
...but he up and croaked
on his own.

00:11:51.580 --> 00:11:54.110
You mustn't talk about
your father that way.

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:00.920
The important thing now is, where
is that Demon Tome right now?

00:12:01.290 --> 00:12:03.520
I know where it is!

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:12.100
Disgaea

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:19.040
Disgaea

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:21.440
I know where it is!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.810
Who's there?

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:27.610
It's been a long time,
Prince!

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:30.710
Oh, you two know
each other?

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.910
No, I don't know
this little piggy.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.490
Hand that over!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.060
Laharl!

00:12:45.170 --> 00:12:47.230
You pig, there isn't
a single crumb left!

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:53.480
Hey, aren't you Koganesky,
Zenisky's son?

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:56.080
Etna! You used to serve
the old Overlord!

00:12:56.950 --> 00:13:00.680
Zenisky? As in my old man's butler?
That Zenisky?

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.320
Do you remember
me now?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.350
Yeah.

00:13:05.860 --> 00:13:08.190
I have a favor to ask,
Prince!

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:09.190
A favor?

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.060
There's also money in it
for you!

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:14.890
You said that you knew where
I could find the Demon Tome.

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:19.570
Wait a minute, is Zenisky using it to claim
the title of Overlord or something?

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.690
Yeah, that's exactly
what he's doing!

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:22.970
This is unforgivable!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.910
How dare he call himself Overlord
without my permission!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.970
I know, that's why I want
you to defeat my father!

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.850
You want me to
off your dad, huh?

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.680
Now that's more like it!

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:39.990
All good little demons
should be like you!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.520
There has to be some reason
for you to ask this.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.420
There is, isn't there?

00:13:48.330 --> 00:13:51.630
The weather report didn't say anything
about a slight chance of spears today!

00:13:51.740 --> 00:13:53.600
Where did you see
a weather report?

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.260
Who's there?!

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:57.230
We'll have your head!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:02.980
What the heck
was that all about?

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:05.450
She said something
about a head.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:10.210
Setting that aside for the moment, Highness,
will you take Koganesky up on his offer?

00:14:12.720 --> 00:14:13.480
Highness?

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:17.650
I'm going there, but it's only so I can
take back the Demon Tome for myself.

00:14:18.260 --> 00:14:21.360
Well, he up and left.
What now?

00:14:23.030 --> 00:14:25.130
You guys stay here and make sure you get
all the money that's coming to us, okay?

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:26.500
Aye aye, dood!

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.400
I better not catch you
pocketing any of it.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:35.670
Wow, has Zenisky really changed
that much since he became Overlord?

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:38.550
Yeah... all he does
is count his money,

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:42.080
not knowing that everyone mocks him behind
his back, calling him a money-grubber.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.680
It's so pathetic...

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:50.960
The truth is, you actually
love your father, don't you?

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:59.070
Koganesky genuinely cares
about Zenisky, so why...

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:03.900
Never mind. Still, are you sure that
you want to ask such a thing?

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:06.130
When they hear that he's been
beaten by the Prince,

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:09.470
...people will stop thinking
of Daddy as the Overlord!

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:12.910
That's why I want the Prince
to beat him to a pulp!

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:16.150
Money, how do I love thee?
Let me count the bills...

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.450
It's been a long time,
Zenisky!

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.650
Who said that?

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.560
Don't try to tell me that you
don't remember my face.

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:33.430
You! You're Laharl,
Krichevskoy's son!

00:15:33.940 --> 00:15:37.300
No, not "Laharl"!
Address me as "Overlord Laharl"!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.430
The way I hear it, you're going around
calling yourself Overlord,

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:46.740
...but with my old man dead, that
makes ME the heir to the Netherworld!

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.510
That's a good one!

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:53.920
In that case, show me the Demon Tome,
the mark of the Overlord!

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:56.180
Tell you what,
you show me yours!

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:57.550
Very well.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:02.430
Oh, that's right.
I left it on this table over here.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:06.700
It's not here! It's gone!
The Demon Tome is missing!

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:08.930
Did you take it?!

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:11.830
I'd never stoop to
such low behavior!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.510
But he'll gladly rob you blind
while you're away from home!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:18.740
Koganesky!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.440
Watch closely. I'm about
to do as you asked.

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:23.490
What does he
mean by that?

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:28.220
I sold the Demon Tome
to the pawn broker!

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:29.090
What?!

00:16:29.190 --> 00:16:31.920
Koganesky?
Why would you do that?

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.850
Koganesky...

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:41.900
Betrayed by your own son! You had the devil's
own luck, but it just ran out, Zenisky!

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:46.470
Silence! All right, you guys!
Take care of him!

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:51.610
What're you doing?!
I'm paying you for times like this!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.580
W-We were wiped out...

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.430
What can I say, your hired muscle
didn't put up much of a fight.

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:08.930
I'll do it myself, then!

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:13.400
Have a taste of my
Darkness Slash!

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:32.810
Earth Shaker!

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:39.650
Daddy!

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:44.260
Looks like I win.

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:47.500
From now on, don't you EVER
claim to be the Overlord.

00:17:47.640 --> 00:17:50.670
I'll also be taking every
last thing you own.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:57.040
You can't! Without money, I won't be able
to pay my power, gas, or water bills!

00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.010
I can't live with all my
utilities turned off!

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:02.850
You have a sword to your throat and
you're STILL pinching pennies?

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.540
That's Zenisky for you...

00:18:04.690 --> 00:18:07.160
Koganesky!
Please, spare me!

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:09.620
What'll it be,
Koganesky?

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:14.090
F-Finish him!

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.630
You're going to forsake
your own father?!

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.740
Begging your son to spare
your life is pathetic.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:23.240
I think I should put you out of
your misery right here and now!

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.780
What do you think you're doing?
Stand aside!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.610
I won't go easy on you
just because you're a kid!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.890
I-I'm not moving!

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:50.720
Why are you protecting your old man?
I thought you wanted me to kill him!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:56.870
Don't you see, Laharl?
This is what love is.

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:58.240
More of your "love" crap?!

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:01.540
Love, love, love! I'm sick of you and your
"love" prattle, you damn Love Freak!

00:19:01.680 --> 00:19:03.700
You can call me whatever you like,
I don't care!

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.910
What's so bad about
believing in love?

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:09.970
You and your people are just refusing
to see the love that's right in front of you!

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:16.320
You, too, Koganesky. Be honest
with yourself about your feelings.

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:19.690
The truth is, you love
your father very much.

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:22.260
I do not!
I hate Daddy!

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.390
I hate him more
than anything!

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.370
Sounds to me like you
like him, though.

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:29.960
I just... I just wanted him to
not be Overlord anymore...

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:32.970
...and go back to being
my plain old Daddy!

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:38.040
I want my old Daddy back,
the one who would play with me!

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:41.840
O my son, forgive me for being the
cause of such loneliness in you!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.650
The fault lies with me!

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:45.650
No, it was I who was
the horrible one!

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:51.390
No, our sorrows can be traced back
to my having neglected you!

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:52.890
Oh, father!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:54.620
My son!

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:56.360
Oh, puke!

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.400
Go spout this crap
somewhere else!

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.150
Did you send them to another
dimension or something?

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:12.610
Are you sure that not finishing him off
was a smart idea?

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:16.550
Killing him wouldn't have earned me any
more money to pay the Prinnies with.

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.210
Oh, so you passed judgment
like Solomon did!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:22.260
Be quiet! Looking at those two made me sick,
so I got rid of them, that's all!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:25.990
Too bad, you had all kinds of
different punishment options.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.030
You could've made an example
of him by exiling him...

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:31.360
...or forcing him to mine gold in the
Netherworld mines for all eternity.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.030
The important thing is, does this place
have anything to eat in it?!

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:35.540
I'll cook you something!

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:36.660
You're off cooking duty!

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.560
That's okay, Flonne!

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.740
Laharl.

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.480
Do you love
your father?

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:51.340
No, I hate you!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.260
Very good, that is the typical
answer for a demon.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:57.490
I don't mind you saying that
for now.

00:20:57.590 --> 00:20:59.930
But one day, I...

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:03.120
I wonder what my old man
was trying to tell me back then?

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:04.820
Laharl!

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:08.100
The Prinnies are done making dinner.
Aren't you going to eat?

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:09.260
Oh, right.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:14.070
Um, would it be okay if I spoke
frankly for a minute?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.810
I was wrong
about you, Laharl.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:25.420
It's true that you're conceited and self-centered
and think the world revolves around you.

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:27.750
And there are plenty more shortcomings
where those came from.

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:29.380
Would you get
to the point, already?!

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:34.690
Today, I discovered the slightest hint
of kindness in your heart!

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:40.300
Oh, would you give it a rest?!
I don't have to stand here and take this!

00:21:40.540 --> 00:21:44.870
Anyway, it's you and your Love Freak crap that
made me think of my old man in the first place!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.100
Hey! Where's the
Demon Tome?!

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:49.540
It's wasn't there,
dood!

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:54.550
What did you say?!
Who the hell bought it?!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:58.910
Laharl, it might be just a small
hint of kindness right now,

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:04.790
but I have great hope that you
will open your eyes to love.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:09.320
What the heck
is this?

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:12.300
Oh, I bought that at the pawn shop
this afternoon.

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:14.490
Isn't the elaborate
binding wonderful?

00:22:18.010 --> 00:22:19.340
- Why, this is...!
- WHY, THIS IS...!

00:22:41.160 --> 00:22:48.590
Aoi hiru ga meguru hoshi de
toki no ruupu mezametara,

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:56.670
chigau kokoro motta mono atsumareba
nanika ga okiru yo.

00:22:56.980 --> 00:23:04.820
Yokubou de umeru no ka?
Ai wa hito no tame ni ugoko no ka?

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:11.880
Dotchi datte kamawanai yo,
suki ni yaru dake.

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:20.330
Hikari to kage kono sekai de
subete ga imi aru egoisuto.

00:23:20.440 --> 00:23:28.140
Hitotsu hitotsu no kakera wa
sou baransu wo ninai ikiteru.

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:39.990
Omou no mama, kokoro no mama ni
ima wa onaji sora no shita...

00:23:40.090 --> 00:23:44.080
...hikari to kage wa kurikaesu.

00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:49.290
Chain react.

00:23:56.010 --> 00:23:58.770
Super-babe treasure hunter Etna
begins her grand adventure...

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:02.610
...in search of a legendary treasure
right now!

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:04.040
Maybe, maybe not, dood.

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:06.770
Mysteries that lie in wait!
Horrifying traps!

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:09.540
When I get the treasure,
it's going to trigger something!

00:24:09.650 --> 00:24:11.120
Maybe, maybe not, dood.

00:24:11.550 --> 00:24:16.860
Next time on Disgaea! "The Dungeon
of Temptation! Maybe, Maybe Not..."

00:24:16.960 --> 00:24:18.480
Maybe, maybe not, dood.

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:20.060
This seems kinda iffy.
Are they really gonna air it?

00:24:20.060 --> 00:24:24.960
Next Time:
The Dungeon of Temptation!
Maybe, Maybe Not...
